OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI agents get rebrand - as 'dots' -
OL,4,Awhile safety worries delay new model
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI in recent months has come under
OL,7,Fintense scrutiny as internal tests of
OL,8,Fits AI agents have revealed often
OL,9,Funexpected and occasionally harmful
OL,10,Factions, leading to more public and
OL,11,Fgovernment fears.
OL,13,FDots, however, were pitched as brightly
OL,14,Fcolored cute cartoons meant to function
OL,15,Fas digital assistants for people with
OL,16,Fbusy lives.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
