OL,3,AOura pulls $15bn stock market listing
OL,4,Adays after announcement
OL,5,
OL,6,FOura has pulled its plan to sell shares
OL,7,Fin its business on the US stock market,
OL,8,Fin a move which would have valued the
OL,9,Ffirm at $15bn (#11.3bn), just days
OL,10,Fafter announcing it.
OL,12,FThe maker of smart rings which track
OL,13,Ftheir owners' health said it would
OL,14,Fpostpone its flotation "due to
OL,15,Funcertainty in the Initial Public
OL,16,FOffering (IPO) market" and did not say
OL,17,Fwhen it might go ahead.
OL,19,FOura had filed official documents
OL,20,Fsetting out plans to raise up to $2.2bn
OL,21,Fby offering shares in the business to
OL,22,Finvestors just over a week ago.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
